:question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-25d2ead3-cfcb-5726-b6ad-7e3e0645bcae"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-25d2ead3-cfcb-5726-b6ad-7e3e0645bcae" :answer-field/id #uuid "25d2ead3-cfcb-5726-b6ad-7e3e0645bcae" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3fd3ec45-844e-5d7b-9b80-178c7ce40b0e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1fc1138d-b64d-5082-89d9-b3b84611ecfa" "answer-4eabe352-2553-5b7c-855b-8e81885bb9b6" "answer-80662819-e21b-5a80-b6b5-cdd6e678d445" "answer-9703411c-630f-5902-bc32-abff536bb656" "answer-3fd3ec45-844e-5d7b-9b80-178c7ce40b0e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1fc1138d-b64d-5082-89d9-b3b84611ecfa" :answer/id #uuid "1fc1138d-b64d-5082-89d9-b3b84611ecfa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,5.25]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4eabe352-2553-5b7c-855b-8e81885bb9b6" :answer/id #uuid "4eabe352-2553-5b7c-855b-8e81885bb9b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(29.25,5.25)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-80662819-e21b-5a80-b6b5-cdd6e678d445" :answer/id #uuid "80662819-e21b-5a80-b6b5-cdd6e678d445" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[29.25,5.25]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9703411c-630f-5902-bc32-abff536bb656" :answer/id #uuid "9703411c-630f-5902-bc32-abff536bb656" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{29.25,15,11.25,3,-1,5.25\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3fd3ec45-844e-5d7b-9b80-178c7ce40b0e" :answer/id #uuid "3fd3ec45-844e-5d7b-9b80-178c7ce40b0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{29.25,15,11.25,3,0,-1,5.25\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-b868c541-58e5-5131-8ec5-c685d5ff37ca" :question/id #uuid "b868c541-58e5-5131-8ec5-c685d5ff37ca" :question/math-academy-id "q-54965" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f$ defined by the following table?\n\n| $x$ | $-4$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $2$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ |" :question/worked-solution "The range of $f(x)$ consists of all the outputs that have a corresponding $x$-input.\n\nIn a table, the range consists of all numbers that feature in the row corresponding to $f(x).$\n\nTherefore, the range is the set $\\{1,2,3,4\\}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-abdc0fd2-3497-5511-9719-4d38e8827235"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-abdc0fd2-3497-5511-9719-4d38e8827235" :answer-field/id #uuid "abdc0fd2-3497-5511-9719-4d38e8827235" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a4078208-f82f-58ea-a06a-9183c0a39a85" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e4ae3fc3-cd5c-5fd4-9466-6ba1a8dc3f8b" "answer-14c41c16-9803-55fa-a5ea-e27f258697f9" "answer-b0685845-823d-5102-8576-378e2adb4ec5" "answer-a4078208-f82f-58ea-a06a-9183c0a39a85" "answer-3a1175ce-ad9d-5809-b45e-508cf644005e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e4ae3fc3-cd5c-5fd4-9466-6ba1a8dc3f8b" :answer/id #uuid "e4ae3fc3-cd5c-5fd4-9466-6ba1a8dc3f8b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-4,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-14c41c16-9803-55fa-a5ea-e27f258697f9" :answer/id #uuid "14c41c16-9803-55fa-a5ea-e27f258697f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-4,-3,-2,-1,0\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b0685845-823d-5102-8576-378e2adb4ec5" :answer/id #uuid "b0685845-823d-5102-8576-378e2adb4ec5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{0,1,2,3\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a4078208-f82f-58ea-a06a-9183c0a39a85" :answer/id #uuid "a4078208-f82f-58ea-a06a-9183c0a39a85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{1,2,3,4\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3a1175ce-ad9d-5809-b45e-508cf644005e" :answer/id #uuid "3a1175ce-ad9d-5809-b45e-508cf644005e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{1,2,3\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-3945419b-cbc3-5382-8a24-c717f52753bb" :question/id #uuid "3945419b-cbc3-5382-8a24-c717f52753bb" :question/math-academy-id "q-79265" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f$ defined by the following table?\n\n| $x$ | $-9$ | $-7$ | $-5$ | $-3$ | $0$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | $\\frac{3}{2}$ | $\\frac{5}{2}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $\\frac{3}{2}$ | $-3$ | $5$ | $8$ | $4$ | $\\frac{3}{2}$ | $-3$ | $4$ |" :question/worked-solution "The range of $f(x)$ consists of all the outputs that have a corresponding $x$-input.\n\nIn a table, the range consists of all numbers that feature in the row corresponding to $f(x).$\n\nTherefore, the range is the set $\\{-3,\\frac{3}{2},4,5,8\\}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7c0d37ee-e575-5337-97f1-9a2aaec2c86a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7c0d37ee-e575-5337-97f1-9a2aaec2c86a" :answer-field/id #uuid "7c0d37ee-e575-5337-97f1-9a2aaec2c86a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-cb7373de-854a-513c-b9f1-1eaeb8612bff" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0663c337-1271-56f3-bbc1-7801324d950a" "answer-84c00d66-7ff1-5312-bc22-95db44f19e2a" "answer-59fa25b2-7ea0-5451-9577-044908cbf4b8" "answer-728a8336-fa69-5dc3-9980-645b06c7081a" "answer-cb7373de-854a-513c-b9f1-1eaeb8612bff"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0663c337-1271-56f3-bbc1-7801324d950a" :answer/id #uuid "0663c337-1271-56f3-bbc1-7801324d950a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-3,8)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-84c00d66-7ff1-5312-bc22-95db44f19e2a" :answer/id #uuid "84c00d66-7ff1-5312-bc22-95db44f19e2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\frac{3}{2},8)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-59fa25b2-7ea0-5451-9577-044908cbf4b8" :answer/id #uuid "59fa25b2-7ea0-5451-9577-044908cbf4b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-3,4,5,8\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-728a8336-fa69-5dc3-9980-645b06c7081a" :answer/id #uuid "728a8336-fa69-5dc3-9980-645b06c7081a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-3,8\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cb7373de-854a-513c-b9f1-1eaeb8612bff" :answer/id #uuid "cb7373de-854a-513c-b9f1-1eaeb8612bff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-3,\\frac{3}{2},4,5,8\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-aa05eb09-9ab6-5ac2-b2dd-bab3e1656e0c" :question/id #uuid "aa05eb09-9ab6-5ac2-b2dd-bab3e1656e0c" :question/math-academy-id "q-223782" :question/problem "![](images/0c/0c18987fb16fc67df39e9887f152b2c6f38649b58e4bf469c80feb908eded8d2.png)\n\nWhat is the range of the function $f(x),$ shown above?\n\n{{field-1}}\n$<\\,f(x)$\n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the lowest and highest $y$-values in the graph.\n\n- The lowest $y$-value is $2.$ This occurs at the point $(2,2).$\n\n- The highest $y$-value is $6.$ This occurs at the point $(-2,6).$\n\nThe function covers all the $y$-values between $2$ and $6,$ but not including $2$ nor $6.$\n\nTherefore, the range is $2<y<6,$ which can also be written as $2<f(x)<6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d4aa10cd-476a-5a7d-a63f-dcb3c8018761" "answer-field-f90dffe7-5f7c-50b9-8f60-36a09cdbbb47" "answer-field-10804da5-cf35-5cd3-8082-0a562cf7ce3a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d4aa10cd-476a-5a7d-a63f-dcb3c8018761" :answer-field/id #uuid "d4aa10cd-476a-5a7d-a63f-dcb3c8018761" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-8684e22b-15e0-5e8a-afcb-e8c9f5f0b375" :answer-field/choices ["answer-8684e22b-15e0-5e8a-afcb